  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Start animation <b>anim</b> for agent that granted <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_TRIGGER_ANIMATION" target="_blank">PERMISSION_TRIGGER_ANIMATION</a> if the permission has not been revoked.</p>
</p>
