          <td>Animation / anim</td>
          <td>an item in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in&#32;or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Internal_Animations" target="_blank">built-in animation</a></td>
